Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:06.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind the scenes the selection was\Nbeing filmed Last Evaluation YG's own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:12.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,documentary series followed seven\Ntrainees competing for a lineup no one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:16.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,would guarantee The footage showed a\Ncompany deliberately withholding the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:21.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,answer letting the girls and the\Naudience sit inside the uncertainty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:25.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ahyeon made the label's shortlist of\Nfive as the complete package
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:31.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,a kid from Chuncheon who sang in\NEnglish at five Mandarin at seven and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:35.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,danced like she'd been on stage since\Nshe was five Not a reference A first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,language music The question was never\Nwhether she fit an old mold but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:45.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,whether YG was ready to build a new\Ngroup around a voice that refused to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:45.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,fit one
